ICT Testing Baseline
  packages/core/data/baseline.yaml lists Baseline Test IDs, titles and the WCAG success
  criteria and Section 508 provisions each test cites, taken from the ICT Testing Baseline
  for Web (v3.1) and the ICT Testing Baseline for Electronic Documents (v1.0).
  Source: Federal Chief Information Officers Council (CIOC) Accessibility Community of
  Practice (ACOP), https://www.cio.gov/about/accessibility-cop/
  Distribution: https://github.com/atbcb/ICTTestingBaseline (commit
  082e144ef2219bb66ce530018e1e4fb2534352b2). Copyright (c) 2018 CIOC ACOP, used under the
  ACOP information usage permission in that repository's LICENSE file.
  The selection and arrangement in baseline.yaml, and the "basis" entries for tests whose
  instructions cite no criterion, are Widedoor's and are not attributed to the ACOP.

axe-core
  packages/core/data/axe-map.yaml is generated from rule metadata in axe-core 4.14.0,
  Copyright (c) 2015 - 2026 Deque Systems, Inc., licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0
  (https://github.com/dequelabs/axe-core). axe-core is used unmodified.

veraPDF validation profiles
  packages/core/data/verapdf-map.yaml references rule ids (clause and test number) of the
  PDF/UA-1 validation profile in https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-validation-profiles
  (commit c4f57effb0d3618827c87bd71882930d752be6e3). The profile itself is not included.

W3C Web Content Accessibility Guidelines
  packages/core/data/wcag.yaml lists success criterion numbers, titles and levels from
  WCAG 2.1 (https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG21/) and WCAG 2.0 (https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG20/).
  Copyright World Wide Web Consortium. https://www.w3.org/copyright/document-license-2023/

